          {
            "title": "Function",
            "id": 89381,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita dapat menggunakan list comprehension untuk membuat list baru dengan menerapkan fungsi seperti <code>halve()</code> ke setiap elemen dari list yang sudah ada seperti <code>prices</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"62\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"halve\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num/\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /></content></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Function 2",
            "id": 89382,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fungsi yang akan kita gunakan, <code>halve()</code>, menerima angka <code>num</code> sebagai argumen dan mengembalikan setengahnya dengan <code>num/2</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"62\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"halve\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num/\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"64\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>num</code>, diikuti oleh <code>num/2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Definisikan <code>halve()</code> agar menerima angka <code>num</code> dan mengembalikan setengahnya.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"62\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"halve\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num/\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"num*2\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2/num\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"num+2\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>num</code>, diikuti oleh <code>num/2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Loop",
            "id": 89383,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Seperti sebelumnya, kita mulai dengan mengiterasi setiap <code>price</code> dalam list <code>prices</code> asli menggunakan loop <code>for</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"62\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"halve\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num/\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"halved = [halve(price) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(halved)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"109\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[5.0, 11.0, 15.0, 20.0, 29.0, 31.0]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>for price in prices</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Function as an expression",
            "id": 89384,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita bisa memilih operasi yang ingin diterapkan ke setiap nilai <code>price</code> dalam fungsi seperti <code>halve()</code>, lalu menggunakannya sebagai ekspresi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"62\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"halve\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num/\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"halved = [halve(price) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(halved)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"89\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[5.0, 11.0, 15.0, 20.0, 29.0, 31.0]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>halve</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, lalu <code>price</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat <code>halved</code> dengan memanggil <code>halve()</code> pada setiap <code>price</code> dalam <code>prices</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"62\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"halve\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num/\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"halved = [halve(price) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(halved)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"99\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"halved\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"num\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[5.0, 11.0, 15.0, 20.0, 29.0, 31.0]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>halve</code>, diikuti oleh <code>price</code>, <code>price</code>, dan terakhir <code>prices</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Multiple expressions",
            "id": 89670,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fungsi berguna saat kita ingin menerapkan lebih banyak ekspresi, seperti menghapus pajak sebelum membagi dua harga.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"halve\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  no_tax = \" /><text value=\"0.85\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" * num\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" no_tax/\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"halved = [halve(price) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(halved)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"90\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[4.25, 9.35, 12.75, 17.0, 24.65, 25.5]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>no_tax = 0.85 * num</code>, diikuti oleh <code>no_tax/2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fungsi memungkinkanmu menerapkan beberapa ekspresi pada setiap elemen list.</p><p>Dalam <code>halve()</code>, ambil dahulu 85% harga dengan <code>0.85 * num</code>, lalu kembalikan nilai tersebut dibagi <code>2</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"halve\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  no_tax = \" /><text value=\"0.85\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" * num\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" no_tax/\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"halved = [halve(price) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(halved)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"no_tax = 0.85 + num\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"no_tax*2\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[4.25, 9.35, 12.75, 17.0, 24.65, 25.5]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>no_tax = 0.85 * num</code>, diikuti oleh <code>no_tax/2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Return statement",
            "id": 89671,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita hanya bisa menggunakan fungsi yang memiliki pernyataan <code>return</code> karena kita sebenarnya menambahkan nilai yang dikembalikan ke list baru.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"prices = [\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"62\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"halve\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num/\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"halved = [halve(price) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(halved)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"59\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[5.0, 11.0, 15.0, 20.0, 29.0, 31.0]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>return</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Function as an expression",
            "id": 89665,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana cara menggunakan pemanggilan fungsi sebagai ekspresi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Kita memanggil fungsi dengan variabel loop sebagai argumen untuk menerapkannya pada setiap elemen list</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Kita memanggil fungsi tanpa argumen apa pun</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Kita memanggil fungsi dengan variabel loop sebagai argumen untuk menerapkannya pada setiap elemen list.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk menerapkan fungsi pada setiap elemen list, panggil fungsi dengan variabel loop sebagai argumennya.</p><p>Comprehension mana yang memanggil <code>halve()</code> pada setiap nilai dalam <code>prices</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[halve(price) for price in prices]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[halve() for price in prices]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[price for halve(price) in prices]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>[halve(price) for price in prices]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Multiple expressions",
            "id": 89673,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mengapa kita perlu menggunakan fungsi sebagai ekspresi dalam list comprehension?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Untuk menerapkan beberapa ekspresi pada nilai yang sedang kita iterasikan</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Karena expression selalu berupa fungsi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Untuk menerapkan beberapa ekspresi pada nilai yang sedang kita iterasikan.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fungsi yang digunakan sebagai ekspresi dapat menerapkan beberapa perhitungan ke setiap nilai dalam list comprehension.</p><p>Situasi mana yang merupakan alasan tepat untuk memanggil fungsi dalam ekspresi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Setiap harga memerlukan beberapa langkah perhitungan sebelum masuk ke list baru</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">List yang ada harus digunakan tanpa mengubah nilai apa pun</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Hanya nilai pertama yang harus disalin ke list baru</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Setiap harga memerlukan beberapa langkah perhitungan sebelum masuk ke list baru.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Return statement",
            "id": 89674,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bisakah kita menggunakan fungsi ini di dalam list comprehension?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_full_name\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  full = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Claire&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;Johnson&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(full)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Tidak, karena fungsi itu tidak mengembalikan nilai</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ya, kita bisa menggunakan fungsi apa pun di dalam list comprehension</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Tidak, karena fungsi itu tidak mengembalikan nilai.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk memasukkan nama lengkap hasil perhitungan ke list baru, fungsi harus mengembalikan nama tersebut, bukan hanya mencetaknya.</p><p>Baris mana yang harus menggantikan <code>print(full)</code> untuk mengembalikan nama hasil perhitungan?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_full_name\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  full = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Claire&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;Johnson&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(full)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>return full</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>return \"full\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>return \"Claire\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>return full</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Function",
            "id": 89666,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Di dalam list comprehension, panggil fungsi <code>add_comma()</code> dengan variabel loop <code>name</code> sebagai argumen.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"authors = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Virginia Woolf&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;John Steinbeck&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"add_comma\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  parts = name.split(\" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" parts[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] + \" /><text value=\"&quot;, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + parts[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"authors_update = [add_comma(name) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" authors]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(authors_update)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"150\" endIndex=\"159\" /><option startIndex=\"159\" endIndex=\"160\" /><option startIndex=\"160\" endIndex=\"164\" /><option startIndex=\"164\" endIndex=\"165\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Woolf, Virginia', 'Steinbeck, John']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>add_comma</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, lalu <code>name</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat <code>authors_update</code> dengan memanggil <code>add_comma()</code> pada setiap <code>name</code> dalam <code>authors</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"authors = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Virginia Woolf&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;John Steinbeck&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"add_comma\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  parts = name.split(\" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" parts[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] + \" /><text value=\"&quot;, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + parts[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"authors_update = [add_comma(name) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" authors]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(authors_update)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"150\" endIndex=\"159\" /><option startIndex=\"160\" endIndex=\"164\" /><option startIndex=\"170\" endIndex=\"174\" /><option startIndex=\"178\" endIndex=\"185\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"authors_update\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"parts\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Woolf, Virginia', 'Steinbeck, John']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>add_comma</code>, diikuti oleh <code>name</code>, <code>name</code>, dan terakhir <code>authors</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Function 2",
            "id": 89667,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Di dalam fungsi <code>add_comma()</code>, pisahkan nama menjadi list bernama <code>parts</code> menggunakan <code>split()</code>. Lalu tambahkan koma di antara indeks <code>1</code> dan indeks <code>0</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"authors = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Virginia Woolf&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;John Steinbeck&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"add_comma\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  parts = name.split(\" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" parts[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] + \" /><text value=\"&quot;, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + parts[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"authors_update = [add_comma(name) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" authors]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(authors_update)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"130\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Woolf, Virginia', 'Steinbeck, John']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>parts = name.split(\" \")</code>, diikuti oleh <code>parts[1] + \", \" + parts[0]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Di dalam <code>add_comma()</code>, pisahkan <code>name</code> pada spasi menjadi <code>parts</code>, lalu kembalikan nama belakang, koma, dan nama depan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"authors = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Virginia Woolf&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;John Steinbeck&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"add_comma\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  parts = name.split(\" /><text value=\"&quot; &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" parts[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] + \" /><text value=\"&quot;, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + parts[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"authors_update = [add_comma(name) \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" authors]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(authors_update)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"130\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"parts = name.split(&quot;,&quot;)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"parts[0] + &quot;, &quot; + parts[1]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Woolf, Virginia', 'Steinbeck, John']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>parts = name.split(\" \")</code>, diikuti oleh <code>parts[1] + \", \" + parts[0]</code>.</p></body></html>",
